      "text": "Dabbler : used Docker during a given month, but hadn’t reached significant use as defined by Adopter. Adopter : the average number of containers running during the month was at least 50% the number of distinct hosts run, or there were at least as many distinct containers as distinct hosts run during the month. Docker Adoption",
